== ui_card "Form Helpers"
  p The <code>ui_text_field</code> helper creates an inline-editable text field.
  
  h4 Usage
  pre style="background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1rem; border-radius: 4px;"
    code == ui_text_field "field_name", "Current Value", url: "/update/endpoint"
    
  h4 Example
  p Click the text below to edit:
  == ui_text_field "demo", "Click me to edit...", url: "#"
